WEBVTT

00:08.641 --> 00:16.683
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.683 --> 00:24.681
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.198 --> 00:36.002
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.002 --> 00:39.005
Believing, dreaming

00:39.005 --> 00:42.842
We are searching

00:42.842 --> 00:47.973
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:49.783 --> 00:58.191
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.191 --> 01:02.762
For the color of the world to change?

01:02.762 --> 01:05.432
Ah, surely someday

01:05.432 --> 01:13.706
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:13.706 --> 01:18.666
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.213 --> 01:26.846
Let's begin our journey

01:33.993 --> 01:38.298
If only I'd known, I would have
brought Heimdall along!

01:38.298 --> 01:40.800
But I never thought jumbo-size pumpkins

01:40.800 --> 01:43.268
would be going for 300 yen a piece

01:45.572 --> 01:47.369
at today's Special Savings Event.

01:57.517 --> 01:58.950
That was a close call.

02:02.889 --> 02:08.521
The 9th Night
Mayura's Surefire Way to Pass Tests?!

02:10.363 --> 02:13.166
Given the results of this quiz,
I'm sure you can see why

02:13.166 --> 02:16.294
the class average for your
entire grade has dropped!

02:17.737 --> 02:22.542
Therefore, the 10 lowest scorers on
the upcoming midterm exam

02:22.542 --> 02:26.478
will have to take after-school
classes for a month.

02:27.380 --> 02:28.904
What?!

02:29.315 --> 02:31.442
What's wrong, Daidoji?

02:31.584 --> 02:33.313
And Narugami?

02:40.693 --> 02:43.396
Oh, boy. If I have to take after-school
classes or whatever,

02:43.396 --> 02:45.632
I won't be able to go over to Loki's anymore.

02:45.632 --> 02:47.934
This is a matter of life and death for me!

02:47.934 --> 02:52.071
If I lose any more time from my jobs,
I'll starve to death.

02:52.071 --> 02:54.869
Hey, you can deal with a little hunger!

02:55.375 --> 02:58.578
I, on the other hand, won't be able to
chase after the unusual anymore!

02:58.578 --> 03:00.947
There'll be no more mysteries for me!

03:00.947 --> 03:03.472
That's something... that's something
I just couldn't stand!

03:07.053 --> 03:08.521
A 100!

03:08.521 --> 03:10.250
Oh, sorry about that.

03:12.058 --> 03:13.457
Thanks.

03:14.527 --> 03:16.930
So you get good grades, huh?

03:16.930 --> 03:18.097
Not really...

03:18.097 --> 03:19.997
But of course I would on
something as simple as this.

03:20.833 --> 03:22.630
That was pretty uncool.

03:23.903 --> 03:27.407
I'll bet he's hired a home tutor or something.

03:27.407 --> 03:32.208
Those smarty-pants rich kids never
turn out to be good adults anyway.

03:32.645 --> 03:33.873
That's right!

03:34.180 --> 03:35.515
Now hold on...

03:35.515 --> 03:38.973
Even if I do have a home tutor,
I'm the one who's doing the studying.

03:39.452 --> 03:43.252
You slackers don't have
any right to complain.

03:43.890 --> 03:45.225
Quite right...

03:45.225 --> 03:47.627
I don't have any comeback for that.

03:47.627 --> 03:48.924
Indeed.

03:52.165 --> 03:55.464
That's what I thought.
So you've decided to study harder?

03:56.102 --> 03:57.203
Right.

03:57.203 --> 04:00.104
We've decided to turn over a new leaf
and really start studying.

04:00.406 --> 04:02.242
Right, Narugami?

04:02.242 --> 04:03.243
Yup!

04:03.243 --> 04:05.541
Where there's a will there's a way!

04:07.547 --> 04:10.550
Fine, but why did you make it a
point of coming here to do it?

04:10.550 --> 04:13.653
The thing is, if I go home,
I'll just end up taking a nap.

04:13.653 --> 04:16.656
Besides, if we come here we can eat!

04:16.656 --> 04:18.180
Right, Four-Eyes?

04:18.625 --> 04:20.422
Ah, well...

04:22.262 --> 04:25.891
And on that note, Loki, you're
interrupting our studies.

04:26.332 --> 04:27.594
Scram, all right?

04:44.484 --> 04:46.386
Yes! Your turn, Narugami!

04:46.386 --> 04:48.445
Damn! I'm not losing!

04:49.022 --> 04:51.889
Okay... Just a little more...

04:54.460 --> 04:55.757
Oh, no!

04:57.297 --> 04:58.631
I did it!

04:58.631 --> 05:00.360
That's 13 wins in a row!

05:01.701 --> 05:05.138
Just a little more! Just a little more
and I could've beaten her!

05:05.138 --> 05:07.197
You stinkin' little...

05:13.046 --> 05:15.742
What did you two even come here for?

05:17.650 --> 05:20.448
If you're not going to study, then go home.

05:21.454 --> 05:24.190
But I don't understand this stuff at all!

05:24.190 --> 05:26.818
We'll never get good enough in time,
no matter how hard we study!

05:28.194 --> 05:30.063
Listen, Mayura...

05:30.063 --> 05:32.725
You can't say that if you don't even try!

05:32.932 --> 05:35.901
Nah, I'm confident I won't.

05:36.502 --> 05:39.972
I'll keep falling asleep in class,

05:39.972 --> 05:44.043
and stopping by here all the time and
going along on mystery hunts,

05:44.043 --> 05:46.212
so there's no way I'll make the grade!

05:46.212 --> 05:47.236
No way!

05:47.647 --> 05:51.150
Then your only choice is to give in and
take some after-school classes.

05:51.150 --> 05:53.353
I can't do that!

05:53.353 --> 05:55.855
C'mon, Loki, do something.

05:55.855 --> 05:57.123
Why me?

05:57.123 --> 06:01.761
Because you might lose an excellent
assistant for a whole month.

06:01.761 --> 06:04.630
And if that happens, you'll be so lonely!

06:04.630 --> 06:07.531
It'll be so tough on you, you might even cry.

06:08.000 --> 06:09.502
I doubt it.

06:09.502 --> 06:12.699
Fine! I won't ask you for anything else.

06:13.606 --> 06:15.108
Let's go, Narugami.

06:15.108 --> 06:16.006
Oh... right!

06:21.414 --> 06:23.382
It turned out pretty good.

06:27.286 --> 06:29.254
There's plenty more where this came from!

06:33.860 --> 06:34.827
Hey.

06:35.795 --> 06:39.492
Frey, do you know about the
red gem that was in here?

06:39.832 --> 06:41.567
Red gem?

06:41.567 --> 06:45.838
Ah, you must mean the one that
glitters so beautifully.

06:45.838 --> 06:48.568
Well, I happen to use it
as a brooch, right...

06:50.309 --> 06:51.477
It's gone!

06:51.477 --> 06:53.172
Don't tell me you...

06:53.546 --> 06:55.673
Seem to have lost it.

06:56.048 --> 06:57.383
What was that?

06:57.383 --> 06:59.180
Gripe gripe gripe gripe gripe gripe!

06:59.786 --> 07:01.487
Oh, be quiet.

07:01.487 --> 07:03.489
Listen, that red gem is...

07:03.489 --> 07:05.457
Just hold on a second.

07:06.659 --> 07:08.286
Hey! Frey!

07:13.766 --> 07:15.734
What do I do now?

07:18.905 --> 07:20.702
This should do fine.

07:26.679 --> 07:29.204
I tried talking to Loki...

07:29.849 --> 07:32.718
but I guess the only choice
we have is to cheat.

07:32.718 --> 07:34.845
I won't stoop to being dishonest.

07:35.488 --> 07:37.023
I guess you're right.

07:37.023 --> 07:39.958
Cheating isn't the way to go.

07:42.061 --> 07:44.029
Wow...

07:51.037 --> 07:54.370
This big tree wasn't here before, was it?

07:54.707 --> 07:56.576
What the heck is going on?

07:56.576 --> 07:58.811
They say that a god lives inside the tree.

07:58.811 --> 08:03.407
If you take one of its leaves,
it can make any wish come true!

08:03.616 --> 08:05.743
I hear it really works too!

08:08.688 --> 08:10.519
Grant any wish, huh?

08:11.290 --> 08:12.587
That's it!

08:12.692 --> 08:14.125
Hey, where are you going?!

08:14.760 --> 08:17.797
To get one of its leaves, of course!

08:17.797 --> 08:20.630
I mean, this is a tree that grants wishes!

08:20.900 --> 08:22.935
You'd better hurry and get yours too!

08:22.935 --> 08:24.630
Hey! Gimme one!

08:25.371 --> 08:27.240
I'm Thor, for crying out loud!

08:27.240 --> 08:31.199
You think I'd swallow my pride and
make a wish to another god?!

08:32.078 --> 08:33.375
Me too!

08:34.046 --> 08:36.173
Still...

08:37.517 --> 08:40.816
Whoa, hold on! Give me one too!

08:54.100 --> 08:56.864
Yeah, if you want the next volume,
it's on the second shelf.

09:00.406 --> 09:02.874
You can sure study, Ecchan.

09:03.776 --> 09:06.078
Mayura could learn a thing or two from you.

09:06.078 --> 09:07.602
Loki!

09:08.180 --> 09:10.148
Well, speak of the devil.

09:15.988 --> 09:18.752
Hi, Loki!

09:19.458 --> 09:21.392
Merry Christmas!

09:24.063 --> 09:29.399
Look! I finally figured out a
surefire way to pass tests!

09:29.569 --> 09:30.934
A surefire way?

09:31.237 --> 09:33.398
A prayer to the gods!

09:33.606 --> 09:35.041
I'm with the Mystery Society,

09:35.041 --> 09:39.740
so I have to put this mysterious
and unknown stuff to use!

09:40.346 --> 09:42.949
And what exactly is the outfit for?

09:42.949 --> 09:44.283
This?

09:44.283 --> 09:46.652
Well, this is Santa's outfit, and he's
known for bringing good fortune.

09:46.652 --> 09:50.189
And these earrings allow me to hear
divine messages from heaven.

09:50.189 --> 09:53.459
Then I've got this ring that contains
the aura of ancient Egypt

09:53.459 --> 09:55.795
and a pendant from Atlantis.

09:55.795 --> 09:56.462
Okay, enough already.
And a pendant from Atlantis.

09:56.462 --> 09:57.330
Okay, enough already.

09:57.330 --> 09:59.798
Ah, you probably think I'm silly.

10:00.032 --> 10:03.636
But you won't have that look on
your face when you see this!

10:03.636 --> 10:05.605
This thing is the latest trend,
and it's selling like hotcakes.

10:05.605 --> 10:07.039
It brings prosperity and health,

10:07.039 --> 10:09.175
and it'll do anything from getting
you out of a financial slump

10:09.175 --> 10:11.310
to keeping you from forgetting
to set your VCR.

10:11.310 --> 10:13.904
This thing will grant any and every wish!

10:14.447 --> 10:15.573
Ta-da!

10:16.282 --> 10:18.584
It's a leaf from a tree that's
inhabited by a god!

10:18.584 --> 10:19.852
As long as I have this...

10:19.852 --> 10:20.353
Put it down!
As long as I have this...

10:20.353 --> 10:21.115
Put it down!

10:21.787 --> 10:23.118
Just do it! Quick!

10:24.023 --> 10:25.820
Uh, okay.

10:32.898 --> 10:34.365
You burned it...

10:35.401 --> 10:37.269
What do you think you're doing, Loki?!

10:37.269 --> 10:38.170
I went through a lot of trouble to get that leaf!

10:38.170 --> 10:39.005
Where did you get from?
I went through a lot of trouble to get that leaf!

10:39.005 --> 10:40.199
Where did you get it from?

10:40.940 --> 10:42.475
Where did you get it?

10:42.475 --> 10:45.342
Um... At Midorigaoka park.

10:45.911 --> 10:51.611
Listen, do not go near that park
until I tell you it's okay.

10:51.951 --> 10:53.019
Got it?

10:53.019 --> 10:53.853
But...

10:53.853 --> 10:55.821
Yamino! Yamino!

11:09.268 --> 11:10.936
Embla?

11:10.936 --> 11:13.268
You mean the bewitched tree, Embla?

11:13.873 --> 11:16.341
Yeah. There's no doubt about it.

11:23.149 --> 11:26.152
In exchange for granting people's wishes,

11:26.152 --> 11:30.111
it steals their life energy and
ultimately kills them.

11:30.790 --> 11:34.749
So even something like this has
shown up in the human world.

11:39.131 --> 11:40.132
Yamino.

11:40.132 --> 11:41.099
Right.

11:48.107 --> 11:50.576
A preemptive attack, eh?

11:50.576 --> 11:51.804
It would seem so.

12:10.329 --> 12:12.297
Sorry, but I've found your weakness!

12:26.112 --> 12:28.580
We're lucky that wasn't a whole lot worse.

12:28.981 --> 12:30.483
Master Loki!

12:30.483 --> 12:31.984
Are you all right?

12:31.984 --> 12:33.018
Yeah.

12:33.018 --> 12:34.754
It's almost dawn.

12:34.754 --> 12:37.450
People will be coming out soon.
C'mon, let's hurry up and get going.

12:37.690 --> 12:38.657
Right.

13:11.957 --> 13:14.255
What the heck is this?!

13:20.099 --> 13:21.964
Now this is what I call a harvest!

13:23.235 --> 13:26.071
Whoa, this one turned out real nice!

13:26.071 --> 13:28.164
Frey, you dirty...

13:32.812 --> 13:34.747
So how was the test?

13:34.747 --> 13:36.578
Don't ask!

13:37.249 --> 13:39.919
It was no good at all. We won't get
them back for another two days,

13:39.919 --> 13:42.046
but it's pretty much a given I'll be
taking after-school classes.

13:42.488 --> 13:44.285
And it's all your fault, you know!

13:45.024 --> 13:45.858
Mine?

13:45.858 --> 13:50.795
All the kids who had leaves are saying
they got the right answers.

13:51.130 --> 13:52.995
They said it worked like a charm.

13:55.301 --> 13:57.792
They had those leaves? You're kidding...

13:58.204 --> 13:59.671
No, really.

14:01.006 --> 14:04.806
The wishes came true even though
Embla itself wasn't there?

14:06.378 --> 14:07.538
Yamino.

14:07.646 --> 14:08.613
Right.

14:10.850 --> 14:12.647
Whoa, wait a second? Where are you going?

14:13.552 --> 14:17.488
After you finish your tea,
go right home and study.

14:18.958 --> 14:20.292
By the way...

14:20.292 --> 14:22.692
You haven't been back to the park, have you?

14:25.364 --> 14:26.956
Hey, uh, Loki?

14:29.268 --> 14:33.138
I was just wondering if there
really is a god in that tree.

14:33.138 --> 14:34.640
Don't be silly!

14:34.640 --> 14:39.211
If there were a god in the tree,
it wouldn't grant people's wishes.

14:39.211 --> 14:40.371
Why not?

14:41.247 --> 14:43.408
Because it would be too busy... I think.

14:46.218 --> 14:48.118
You think so? Really?

14:48.921 --> 14:51.048
There doesn't seem to be anything here.

14:51.657 --> 14:52.057
There's no evil presence, either.

14:52.057 --> 14:53.859
C'mon, stop! That's dangerous.
There's no evil presence, either.

14:53.859 --> 14:54.793
C'mon, stop! That's dangerous.
Is it just a coincidence?

14:54.793 --> 14:55.282
Is it just a coincidence?

14:57.029 --> 14:58.724
I want to do it now!

15:05.638 --> 15:09.199
Heimdall, you rat.
How could you hit me so hard?

15:09.675 --> 15:11.905
I'll pay him back for that someday.

15:12.211 --> 15:15.414
I don't know about this Embla
or tempura or whatever it is.

15:15.414 --> 15:17.616
Who cares about that red gem anyway?

15:17.616 --> 15:21.787
Speaking of which, it should have
fallen somewhere around here.

15:21.787 --> 15:26.622
But more importantly, I must search
for my beloved sister, Freya.

15:34.733 --> 15:36.064
Um...

15:39.838 --> 15:41.863
That's mine.

15:42.107 --> 15:43.233
Did you drop it?

15:51.850 --> 15:54.053
There you go. Take care now.

15:54.053 --> 15:55.520
Thanks!

15:57.289 --> 16:00.918
I hope you find your sister soon.

16:07.633 --> 16:09.260
Farewell, then.

16:45.237 --> 16:48.172
I guess I'll never be able to do it
without one of those leaves.

16:48.841 --> 16:54.040
When I picked one up at the park,
I thought it would be a big help.

16:55.314 --> 16:59.011
Oh, that's right.
Dad's coming home late tonight.

17:01.120 --> 17:03.281
I guess I'll make some onigiri for him.

17:19.505 --> 17:21.740
We'll be open every day from tomorrow,
in front of the station.

17:21.740 --> 17:24.777
The name's Admatic Curry,
and delivery is our specialty.

17:24.777 --> 17:26.176
At your service!

17:26.378 --> 17:28.414
Another part-time job?

17:28.414 --> 17:30.349
Are you sure this won't cut
into your studies?

17:30.349 --> 17:31.417
Shaddup.

17:31.417 --> 17:33.819
We're talking about my livelihood here.

17:33.819 --> 17:37.949
Besides, I've got a secret weapon
for that test.

17:38.290 --> 17:39.621
Secret weapon?

17:40.426 --> 17:41.960
Look and be amazed!

17:41.960 --> 17:43.695
This is from a tree that's
inhabited by a god!

17:43.695 --> 17:44.787
That's...

17:48.767 --> 17:49.995
I knew it.

18:05.350 --> 18:06.618
Mayura!

18:06.618 --> 18:07.812
Loki! This is...

18:08.120 --> 18:12.250
So long as Embla can drain the life force
out of people, it's going to keep growing!

18:14.927 --> 18:16.895
We have to destroy it, quickly!

18:18.530 --> 18:21.021
But why did Mayura...

18:22.768 --> 18:25.396
Whatever the reason, it turns out she
did go to the park again.

18:25.737 --> 18:27.204
Good grief.

18:31.076 --> 18:32.941
Roar, Mjolnir!

18:43.155 --> 18:44.679
I'm telling you I know your...

18:48.460 --> 18:49.358
Mayura!

18:53.699 --> 18:54.597
Master Loki!

18:58.370 --> 18:59.496
My eyes...

19:03.275 --> 19:05.266
I... I can't see.

19:07.513 --> 19:08.914
What is this?!

19:08.914 --> 19:10.182
Let go of me!

19:10.182 --> 19:12.751
What are you doing, you pervert?!

19:12.751 --> 19:14.241
Let go!

19:15.687 --> 19:17.022
To the right?

19:17.022 --> 19:18.546
Maybe a little farther down?

19:19.725 --> 19:20.592
Loki!

19:20.592 --> 19:21.559
Master Loki!

19:26.598 --> 19:28.498
My thanks, Mayura.

19:29.902 --> 19:32.370
It's because of you that I was
able to find the spot.

19:52.791 --> 19:54.418
Master Loki, your eyes...

19:54.560 --> 19:56.357
They'll be all right.

19:57.796 --> 19:59.423
What's all this?

19:59.965 --> 20:02.934
The true form of the tree
that a "god" lived in?

20:03.368 --> 20:06.972
To think that I put faith in this thing...

20:06.972 --> 20:08.439
How pathetic.

20:29.161 --> 20:30.958
Now I see.

20:31.363 --> 20:33.957
I hadn't realized this was its true form.

20:41.540 --> 20:43.475
We were too late.

20:43.475 --> 20:45.500
And it's your fault.

20:45.978 --> 20:48.714
You put one on too, Heimdall.
It'll help you relax.

20:48.714 --> 20:50.082
Watch it.

20:50.082 --> 20:51.250
There's no need to worry.

20:51.250 --> 20:54.219
I cleaned out all the pulp and
left it in the refrigerator.

20:54.886 --> 20:56.820
Nobody is worried here!

20:58.890 --> 21:00.016
Hey.

21:01.293 --> 21:02.419
Loki...

21:03.395 --> 21:06.626
That's for lying to me like you did.
You went back to that park, didn't you?

21:08.700 --> 21:10.292
Well, I...

21:10.535 --> 21:12.738
Listen, Mayura.

21:12.738 --> 21:14.740
I told you before, right?

21:14.740 --> 21:19.040
Gods won't listen to every single
wish people ask of them.

21:19.945 --> 21:21.412
Because they're busy?

21:22.281 --> 21:24.306
Well, that's one reason...

21:24.816 --> 21:26.283
See, gods are...

21:26.718 --> 21:28.686
Gods are?

21:31.189 --> 21:33.123
Mathematics Quiz

21:57.349 --> 21:59.977
The gods are unpredictable.

22:16.768 --> 22:28.737
A moonlit road pierces the dense fog

22:30.449 --> 22:42.194
Perplexedly, we all wander towards tomorrow

22:42.194 --> 22:49.301
We escape the darkness of a desolate town

22:49.301 --> 22:55.741
Which threatens to halt even the telling of myths

22:55.741 --> 23:05.250
Transcending the limitless skies,
we're on a journey

23:05.250 --> 23:09.588
Even if we're hurt

23:09.588 --> 23:21.600
We're sure we can still make it,
so we want to keep on praying

23:21.600 --> 23:23.329
Believe in Heaven

23:31.109 --> 23:32.544
Next Episode

23:32.544 --> 23:35.180
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode are,
"part-time job," "memories," and "coffee shop."

23:35.180 --> 23:37.983
Next Episode
I like to put loads of sugar in my coffee!

23:37.983 --> 23:38.817
Next Episode
Ah, that's no good at all!

23:38.817 --> 23:40.552
Next Episode
Putting sugar in coffee is sacrilege!
Sacrilege, I tell ya!

23:40.552 --> 23:41.920
Next Episode
Oh? Okay then, honey.

23:41.920 --> 23:42.654
Next Episode
That's sacrilege too.

23:42.654 --> 23:43.822
Next Episode
Fine, pure organic honey.

23:43.822 --> 23:45.090
Next Episode
Ah, so close! But not really.

23:45.090 --> 23:46.525
Next Episode
Okay, then something that
kind of looks like honey

23:46.525 --> 23:48.894
Next Episode
and makes you wonder if it is honey,
but when you taste it

23:48.894 --> 23:50.395
Next Episode
you sorta get the feeling
that it isn't honey!

23:50.395 --> 23:52.964
Next Episode
Ah, I... But that would still be honey!

23:52.964 --> 23:53.799
Next Episode

